; iter-256 / Wave 5B — destructible sarcophagus. Squat stone slab
; with the chiseled-stone grammar (top highlight + body + base shadow)
; matching the iter-188 sarcophagus wall theming. Smaller than a
; pillar (40×24 vs the pillar's 36×68), so it reads as a tomb-lid
; rather than a column.
;
; Collision: small rectangle. Layer 1 = world (hero walks AROUND it).

